					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13026562#post-4494740</guid>
				<title>h</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13026562/pastarasta1-s-author-page#post-4494740</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 09 Feb 2020 17:08:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>pastarasta1</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2551139</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Image&nbsp;Attribution</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>No images were used for this page other than my own art.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b9ya39vhJJA">Scratch that.</a></span></h2> <h2><span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b9ya39vhJJA">I'm ready!</a></span></h2> <p>- <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b9ya39vhJJA">There's Something Happening</a></p> </div> <hr /> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Don't update the image formatting, it's intentional!</span></p> <p>Very happy to make this page! I hope you enjoy it! I'll add more to this page every few days, maybe even add more tabs, although that might make things cluttered, but god it's so much fun to write about the stuff I'm interested in!</p> <p>I didn't need much help for this page, but big thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brewsterion-1017" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3093017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581269191" alt="Brewsterion 1017" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3093017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brewsterion-1017" >Brewsterion 1017</a></span> for letting me know on discord how tabs work! Also thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581269191" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span> for helping me make the transparent Bobble icon! For some reason, the drawing program I use was refusing to let me do a transparent image.</p> <p>Theme is made by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581269191" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span></p> <p>Love y'all.</p> <p><tt>thank you for reading!</tt></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
